      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "One day, when he was wandering on the pavement near the bay enjoying the sea scenes, he lost his money and passport that he kept in an envelope. So he went to the embassy to seek help, but the ambassador with rude manners didn’t permit his staff to help though he bowed to him. Staring at his impatient face, he understood that it was the fault of his skin colour that accounted for their rejection.",
        "zh": "一天，他在海湾附近的人行道上漫步，欣赏海景，却弄丢了装在信封里的钱和护照。于是他去大使馆寻求帮助，但态度粗鲁的大使不允许工作人员帮助他，尽管他向大使鞠躬恳求。看着大使不耐烦的脸，他明白，对方介意的是他的肤色，这正是他们拒绝帮助的原因。",
        "start": 35.92,
